{"id":"n78855-1-7","stage":4,"title":"충전 · 充电","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78855-1-7-1","ko":"휴대폰 충전을 하려고 하는데 충전기 있어?","zh":"我想要给手机充电，你有充电器吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"휴대폰","meaning":"手机，移动电话，手提电话","explanation":"휴대폰：手机，移动电话，手提电话。","readings":[{"term":"휴대폰","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88425","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴대폰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴대폰","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3"}},{"text":"충전을","meaning":"充电","explanation":"충전：充电；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"충전","audio":"/audio/01de6fca3ec9d54ab901.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78855","senseId":"1","lemma":"충전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"충전을","audio":"/audio/727429a124d630ab55f6.mp3"}},{"text":"하려고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하려고","audio":"/audio/761078da9d37d7327667.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데","audio":"/audio/f78512dad8d31fc58a77.mp3"}},{"text":"충전기","meaning":"充电器","explanation":"충전기：充电器。","readings":[{"term":"충전기","audio":"/audio/c78361bc7bfab80df7f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78856","senseId":"1","lemma":"충전기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"충전기","audio":"/audio/c78361bc7bfab80df7f0.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2a675ee941a2897e","term":"휴대폰","zh":"手机，移动电话，手提电话","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3","entryId":"88425","definition":"能拿在手里或带在身上，可以接或打的无线电话。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"01de6fca3ec9d54a","term":"충전","zh":"充电","audio":"/audio/01de6fca3ec9d54ab901.mp3","entryId":"78855","definition":"给蓄电池等补充电能。","pronunciation":["충전"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"c78361bc7bfab80d","term":"충전기","zh":"充电器","audio":"/audio/c78361bc7bfab80df7f0.mp3","entryId":"78856","definition":"在储存电能的装置上补充电力的工具。","pronunciation":["충전기"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3a7d50b01fc1d6e6db99.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78855-1-7-2","ko":"응. 내가 빌려줄게.","zh":"有啊。我可以借给你。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려줄게.","meaning":"借；给予，给","explanation":"빌리다：借；주다：给予，给；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI